---
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
// Left: two callers, each with its own copy of the rule (the second copy is
// forgotten or drifting). Right: one service holds the rule, both callers use it.
const W = 900, H = 330;
---
<figure class="bep4e">
  <div class="bep4e-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Left: an HTTP endpoint and a nightly script each hold their own copy of the rule assign a detective first, and the script's copy is dashed red, copied or forgotten. Right: both callers go through one service that holds the rule once.">
    <text x="210" y="26" text-anchor="middle" class="h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>fat router: one rule, two homes</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>fat router: một luật, hai nhà</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="680" y="26" text-anchor="middle" class="h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>layered: one rule, one home</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>chia tầng: một luật, một nhà</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x="40" y="52" width="340" height="96" rx="10" class="box" />
    <DiagramIcon name="web" x={68} y={80} size={24} />
    <text x="96" y="86" class="nm"><tspan data-lang-en>close_case endpoint</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>endpoint close_case</tspan></text>
    <text x="64" y="124" class="sm"><tspan data-lang-en>rule: assign a detective first</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>luật: gán detective trước</tspan></text>

    <rect x="40" y="186" width="340" height="96" rx="10" class="box red" />
    <DiagramIcon name="clock" x={68} y={214} size={24} />
    <text x="96" y="220" class="nm"><tspan data-lang-en>nightly script</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>script chạy hằng đêm</tspan></text>
    <rect x="64" y="236" width="292" height="32" rx="6" class="dash" />
    <text x="78" y="257" class="rt"><tspan data-lang-en>a copy of the rule, or none at all</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>một bản sao của luật, hoặc không có</tspan></text>

    <rect x="500" y="40" width="360" height="100" rx="10" class="box red" />
    <DiagramIcon name="worker" x={528} y={68} size={24} />
    <text x="556" y="74" class="nm"><tspan data-lang-en>service</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>service</tspan></text>
    <text x="524" y="116" class="rt"><tspan data-lang-en>rule: assign a detective first</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>luật: gán detective trước</tspan></text>

    <rect x="500" y="204" width="160" height="62" rx="10" class="box" />
    <DiagramIcon name="web" x={526} y={235} size={22} />
    <text x="548" y="241" class="nm"><tspan data-lang-en>endpoint</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>endpoint</tspan></text>
    <rect x="700" y="204" width="160" height="62" rx="10" class="box" />
    <DiagramIcon name="clock" x={726} y={235} size={22} />
    <text x="748" y="241" class="nm"><tspan data-lang-en>script</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>script</tspan></text>

    <line x1="580" y1="204" x2="580" y2="156" class="ln" />
    <polygon points="580,142 575,156 585,156" class="hd" />
    <line x1="780" y1="204" x2="780" y2="172" class="ln" />
    <line x1="780" y1="172" x2="620" y2="172" class="ln" />
    <line x1="620" y1="172" x2="620" y2="156" class="ln" />
    <polygon points="620,142 615,156 625,156" class="hd" />
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>A second entrance turns a rule into a copy. Put the rule in the service and every entrance calls the same one, so there is nothing to drift.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Lối vào thứ hai biến một luật thành bản sao. Đặt luật trong service thì mọi lối vào gọi cùng một bản, nên không có gì để lệch nhau.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .bep4e { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .bep4e-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .bep4e svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .bep4e text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .bep4e .h { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 15px; }
  .bep4e .nm { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 15px; }
  .bep4e .sm { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12.5px; }
  .bep4e .rt { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; font-size: 13.5px; }
  .bep4e .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .bep4e .box.red { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .bep4e .dash { fill: none; stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.6; stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .bep4e .ln { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.6; fill: none; }
  .bep4e .hd { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .bep4e figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
